Project 1: House Price Prediction | Machine Learning


Machine Learning project — House Price Prediction, completed with SAM AI Technologies. 🚀

📊 Project Objective:
Build a machine learning model that predicts house prices based on relevant property features.

🔍 Key Steps Covered:
• Data cleaning and preprocessing
• Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
• Feature engineering
• Data visualization
• Model training and evaluation
• Prediction of house prices
• Performance evaluation using appropriate metrics

💡 What I learned:

This project helped me strengthen my understanding of the end-to-end Machine Learning workflow, from raw data preprocessing to building and evaluating a predictive model.
It was a great hands-on experience in understanding how data-driven models can be used to solve real-world problems.
